<http://data.silknow.org/object/6ad3ab45-0458-3d57-bc92-fc1ee4271c10/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Shawl of printed wool and silk gauze. The shawl is wovn with a silk and wiil gausze ground with white silk stripes at intervals in the warp and weeft. The shawl is printed with a design of three cones, one larger flanked by two smaller ones. These are containd with a formlal cartouch. the design is repeated over the whole shawl. Around the shawl is a failry narrow border of half medallions. The colouring is predominatly crimson, red, blue and pink."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/6ad3ab45-0458-3d57-bc92-fc1ee4271c10> .

